		"Old format facts, from ~/.hal/src: loadAllHistoryWithOrigin (server/sessions.ts) follows forked_from to the parent's current log and keeps parent records with ts < the fork ts; rewriteHistoryForRebase writes a new historyN.asonl starting with rebased_from, appends rebased_to to the old one and moves currentLog; blobs resolve through the fork parent for inherited records (server/session/blob.ts); record types are in common/history.ts. Read these there; do not copy them into this task.",
